:"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.benchmark_label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎ 我的表現","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"運動科學結合現代科技後，在競技運動上有了突破性的","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「只要獲得獎牌，就有保送升學的機會。」在這個句子裡，前句是「條件」，後句是「結果」，像這樣用條件引出結果的句子，就是條件複句。\n常見的句型有：「只要……就……」、「只有……才……」、「如果……就……」、「無論／不管……都……」、「除非……否則……」、「沒有……就……」。\n讀到條件複句，可以這樣讀懂句子的關係：\n①先圈出關聯詞。\n②找出「要先發生或做到的事」（條件）。\n③找出「接著會出現的結果」（結果）。\n④用「條件 → 結果」說出句子的意思。","n":223,"ssz":".....................1.1..............................1...............................................................................................1...................................................................1..2."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「只要獲得獎牌，就有保送升學的機會。」在這個句子裡，前句是「條件」，後句是「結果」，像這樣用條件引出結果的句子，就是條件複句。","n":63,"ssz":".....................1.1..............................1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"常見的句型有：「只要……就……」、「只有……才……」、「如果……就……」、「無論／不管……都……」、「除非……否則……」、「沒有……就……」。","n":71,"ssz":"......................................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀到條件複句，可以這樣